 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.96,
   "end": 5.28,
   "text": "A computer inside this network starts checking in with an outside server, again and again."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.42,
   "end": 6.87,
   "text": "It's a botnet taking orders."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.9,
   "end": 8.14,
   "text": "And nobody is watching."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.16,
   "end": 11.8,
   "text": "In 2023, ransomware hit PhilHealth."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.04,
   "end": 14.3,
   "text": "About 13 million members' records leaked."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.56,
   "end": 17.52,
   "text": "And the law gives you 72 hours to report a breach."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.48,
   "end": 22.15,
   "text": "Most hospitals, schools and town halls have no security team."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.18,
   "end": 23.5,
   "text": "So who's watching at night?"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.1,
   "end": 28.8,
   "text": "Nightwatch is the night-shift security analyst they can't afford."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.76,
   "end": 31.88,
   "text": "Choose a day of real recorded traffic."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.06,
   "end": 36.32,
   "text": "Nightwatch scores every connection as it streams in, in a fraction of a millisecond."
  },
  {
   "start": 37.28,
   "end": 38.96,
   "text": "Each one gets one of three labels."
  },
  {
   "start": 39.72,
   "end": 40.63,
   "text": "A recognized attack."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.66,
   "end": 43.63,
   "text": "Needs review, when it fits nothing the model knows."
  },
  {
   "start": 43.66,
   "end": 45.94,
   "text": "Or cleared as normal."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.76,
   "end": 49.26,
   "text": "The unknown is never silently dropped."
  },
  {
   "start": 49.46,
   "end": 50.79,
   "text": "Related alerts become one incident,"
  },
  {
   "start": 51.08,
   "end": 55.9,
   "text": "ranked Critical, High, Medium or Low, with its MITRE ATT&CK technique."
  },
  {
   "start": 56.9,
   "end": 58.98,
   "text": "Botnet traffic goes straight to the top."
  },
  {
   "start": 59.9,
   "end": 61.26,
   "text": "Only have 30 minutes?"
  },
  {
   "start": 62.4,
   "end": 63.89,
   "text": "The capacity line shows what fits,"
  },
  {
   "start": 63.92,
   "end": 67.32,
   "text": "and how many real attacks you reach, compared with oldest first."
  },
  {
   "start": 69.08,
   "end": 70.12,
   "text": "Open an incident."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.42,
   "end": 72.02,
   "text": "What happened, in plain words."
  },
  {
   "start": 72.62,
   "end": 76.2,
   "text": "The evidence behind the alert, each with an innocent explanation."
  },
  {
   "start": 77.66,
   "end": 78.92,
   "text": "And what to do first."
  },
  {
   "start": 80.42,
   "end": 84.15,
   "text": "Confirm the threat, and Nightwatch drafts the incident report."
  },
  {
   "start": 84.18,
   "end": 87.04,
   "text": "A timeline, the affected hosts,"
  },
  {
   "start": 87.14,
   "end": 89.6,
   "text": "the four fields the Privacy Commission asks for,"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.86,
   "end": 91.66,
   "text": "and the 72-hour deadline."
  },
  {
   "start": 93.36,
   "end": 94.38,
   "text": "Have your own logs?"
  },
  {
   "start": 95.36,
   "end": 96.62,
   "text": "Upload a flow export."
  },
  {
   "start": 97.3,
   "end": 101.18,
   "text": "It's scored by the same model, in memory, and never stored."
  },
  {
   "start": 101.24,
   "end": 102.18,
   "text": "Nothing is hidden."
  },
  {
   "start": 103.14,
   "end": 107.72,
   "text": "On traffic from later in time, it flags 99.96% of attacks."
  },
  {
   "start": 108.36,
   "end": 110.87,
   "text": "Hide a whole attack family, and it still catches floods,"
  },
  {
   "start": 111.0,
   "end": 113.0,
   "text": "but misses traffic that imitates normal."
  },
  {
   "start": 113.84,
   "end": 115.94,
   "text": "The method page says so."
  },
  {
   "start": 116.4,
   "end": 119.28,
   "text": "We built Nightwatch for DataNova 2026."
  },
  {
   "start": 120.06,
   "end": 123.35,
   "text": "A LightGBM model, trained on a corrected public intrusion dataset,"
  },
  {
   "start": 123.38,
   "end": 126.08,
   "text": "with conformal prediction to measure doubt."
  },
  {
   "start": 126.82,
   "end": 129.15,
   "text": "It runs in TypeScript inside a Next.js app,"
  },
  {
   "start": 129.34,
   "end": 131.4,
   "text": "on Neon Postgres and Neon Auth."
  },
  {
   "start": 133.14,
   "end": 133.94,
   "text": "Nightwatch."
  },
  {
   "start": 134.54,
   "end": 137.26,
   "text": "Your team goes home. Nightwatch stays on."
  }
 ],
